{"steam_appid":3238670,"steam_name":"Conquest Dark","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3238670/876601/6b60e4a1c3a9c992130a7caba617b0fd972ba681/1750825043/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745946365","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130033/aca794a89179b85441bb3e025d39aca22d8b0f4a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745946365","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/c6db3806a04dd7e52a78687f5b9d2c5f60915076/ss_c6db3806a04dd7e52a78687f5b9d2c5f60915076.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786028723","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/164043b2a7f3c6f36f2669c128d2b7906b9b956c/ss_164043b2a7f3c6f36f2669c128d2b7906b9b956c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786028723","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/58a3499777b8e8aaa9fb64d893a4e43bb2eb2bd5/ss_58a3499777b8e8aaa9fb64d893a4e43bb2eb2bd5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786028723","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/289c12e498b7410adf4e26fe7ff27202040331e6/ss_289c12e498b7410adf4e26fe7ff27202040331e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786028723","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/37ca4488218d3aa08c349ebaf608b78d9fd78917/ss_37ca4488218d3aa08c349ebaf608b78d9fd78917.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786028723"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >237 years after the Black Planet's arrival, humanity stands on the brink of annihilation. The undead armies have laid waste to the kingdoms of mankind, the Cosmic Gods have fallen, and the Primordial Ones have awakened from their ancient slumber. Now, champions and criminals alike perform Dark Rituals to face the very forces that brought civilization to its knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE DARK RITUALS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into haunting environments where cosmic horror meets primal savagery. Choose your path from legendary classes like the untamed Barbarians of the Lion, the divine Oathkeepers, or the mysterious Acolytes of Kuu, each mastering unique powers against the darkness.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/3faeab8af68db2c5ce27719443f6bbe6.poster.avif?t=1786028723\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/3faeab8af68db2c5ce27719443f6bbe6.webm?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/3faeab8af68db2c5ce27719443f6bbe6.mp4?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSTANT ACTION RPG GRATIFICATION</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock your power fantasy through intense Ritual runs. Begin as a feeble grunt and discover devastating builds as you progress. Every Ritual delivers the satisfying progression curve of an ARPG in concentrated form, each run bringing you closer to legend status.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/470fc3f6ec709d8081225235f60ca448.poster.avif?t=1786028723\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/470fc3f6ec709d8081225235f60ca448.webm?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/470fc3f6ec709d8081225235f60ca448.mp4?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE GODSLAYING BUILDS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover eldritch abilities, equip legendary armor, and wield unique weapons from fallen champions. Enhance your arsenal and craft builds worthy of slaying gods. Theory-craft your way to godhood with deep customization and endless possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/a246e871f55feddfdd9f7b8382728335.poster.avif?t=1786028723\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/a246e871f55feddfdd9f7b8382728335.webm?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/a246e871f55feddfdd9f7b8382728335.mp4?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE DARKNESS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through diverse environments filled with unique challenges and fearsome mini-bosses. Face deadly creatures, undead armies, and fallen heroes in your quest to uncover the secrets of The Black Planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/a71bcd89f294a23fbaea689aa568f869.poster.avif?t=1786028723\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/a71bcd89f294a23fbaea689aa568f869.webm?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/a71bcd89f294a23fbaea689aa568f869.mp4?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVAGE SWORD &amp; SORCERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a brutal realm of sword &amp; sorcery inspired by the greatest dark fantasy classics of old. Ancient powers and cosmic horrors lurk in every cursed ruin and fallen kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/232731259559e23c37b16cdf993b1638.poster.avif?t=1786028723\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/232731259559e23c37b16cdf993b1638.webm?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238670/extras/232731259559e23c37b16cdf993b1638.mp4?t=1786028723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 OR AMD FX-9590<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1050 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400T OR AMD Ryzen 5 3500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","RPG","Early Access"],"developers":["Eldritch Sword Games"],"publishers":["Mad Mushroom"],"release_date":"30 Apr, 2025"}